Exposure assessment for 2022: `limited_exposure_with_choices`. The local prior shows no internationalized conflict events/fatalities, so this is not an interstate war-of-choice case. The chapter instead turns on how Tshisekedi handled a severe eastern-conflict and cross-border crisis through diplomacy, regional mechanisms, force coordination, and public attribution. I did not score.

